    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control gravity in this first-person, 3D physics-based, puzzle-platformer to reach the end of each trial. The early trials are simpler with limited gravity control with later trials providing more challenge and freedom. You'll be sure to have your navigation and problem-solving skills put to the test. You can also take on a number of bonus levels such as races and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.poster.avif?t=1755360864\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.webm?t=1755360864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.mp4?t=1755360864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAVIT includes a number of other gameplay features  such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freezing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/ec553e0f4bb1710b89975bc37b35624f.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects can be frozen, locking them in place so that they are no longer affected by gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Negation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/dc31b51dfbb4bb1a68bb40ac8cfa96ae.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tiles will prevent you from switching gravity. It's always a good idea to think twice before stepping on them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/f2dbf6920a588110a1e8c21513763d21.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity zones allow you to change gravity without affecting yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powered Doors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/1b7f779431797548c2ff470816421443.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These doors require a power cube to open. The power cube will need to be carried to the door.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Pads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are buttons which will require the player to land on them with sufficient speed to activate.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collectables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/f65dcb1d1a18db437424120667a0f000.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself and extra challenge and locate the collectable orbs hidden throughout each level. As well as giving you a sense of accomplishment, a certain number is required to progress to the second more difficult tier of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-screen cooperative levels are in development with the aim of them being added at a later date.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control gravity in this first-person, 3D physics-based, puzzle-platformer to reach the end of each trial. The early trials are simpler with limited gravity control with later trials providing more challenge and freedom. You'll be sure to have your navigation and problem-solving skills put to the test. You can also take on a number of bonus levels such as races and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.poster.avif?t=1755360864\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.webm?t=1755360864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.mp4?t=1755360864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAVIT includes a number of other gameplay features  such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freezing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/ec553e0f4bb1710b89975bc37b35624f.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects can be frozen, locking them in place so that they are no longer affected by gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Negation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/dc31b51dfbb4bb1a68bb40ac8cfa96ae.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tiles will prevent you from switching gravity. It's always a good idea to think twice before stepping on them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/f2dbf6920a588110a1e8c21513763d21.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity zones allow you to change gravity without affecting yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powered Doors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/1b7f779431797548c2ff470816421443.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These doors require a power cube to open. The power cube will need to be carried to the door.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Pads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are buttons which will require the player to land on them with sufficient speed to activate.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collectables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/f65dcb1d1a18db437424120667a0f000.avif?t=1755360864\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself and extra challenge and locate the collectable orbs hidden throughout each level. As well as giving you a sense of accomplishment, a certain number is required to progress to the second more difficult tier of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-screen cooperative levels are in development with the aim of them being added at a later date.</p>",
    "short_description": "Manipulate gravity to reach the end of each stage in this first-person, physics-based, puzzle-platformer. The game includes a variety of hand-crafted levels and increasingly difficult challenges to put your problem-solving and navigational skills to the test.",
